 "uncertain": [
  "Canvases 32-33 (given for the first Conspectus codicum / Conspectus siglorum) are the end of Pfaff's German preface (Einleitung XXXII-XXXIII), prose only, no sigla list; written as empty sections. The only list is on canvas 34 (before Epid. I title, canvas 35). Its H (Scorialensis arab. 804, Hunain's Arabic version) serves the Epid. II translation.",
  "H: printed as a capital H with a bar across the top (special type for Hunain); transcribed as H.",
  "V/w: Marcianus Venetus 1053 (App. class. V 5) and App. class. V 15 normalized as Marc. gr. App. V 5 / App. V 15."
 ]
